You have Enhanced Security installed on the system and you're having trouble 
accessing the ttys database.  The ttys database is in the file 
/etc/auth/system/ttys.db.  If you haven't customized this file you can try 
just copying the default version (.new..ttys.db or .proto..ttys.db) over the 
ttys.db file and see if that fixes the problem.  See "man ttys" for more 
information on the ttys database.  See the Security manual for more 
information on Enhanced Security.




