This is in what machine?

The GRAPHICS Card ID in the XP1000 is 3D07104C/00081227
This is our original card

They work flawlessly in PWS433/500/600 and anything later

My concern is what kind of system this is installed into.
I think you mentioned an Alphaserver 1000

We don't sell these any longer but as long as the OS is seeing the card AND
the comet0 driver is loaded than
I can't see why it is a problem.

If you do a web search for how to set up an ELSA GLoria Synergy,
(SN-PBXGK-BB) then this will give you detailed instructions on how
to install this card in a Tru64 environment.

Have you tried a clean install of Tru64 to make sure that there is not
something corrupted or perhaps some driver that is still loading when it
shouldn't be.
I AM assuming you took the old card out

